3 Sep 2026","definitions":"- **Arrival:** inferred from the trip-update feed. A feed lists the stops a vehicle has not served yet; when a stop drops off the list while the trip is still reported, the prediction in the last snapshot that listed it is taken as the arrival time.\n- **Counted stops:** intermediate stops of trips matched to the timetable. First stops (the feed echoes the timetable there) and last stops (the trip simply leaves the feed) are excluded; stops reported by several vehicles at once are excluded as ambiguous.\n- **On time:** delay between −60 s and +300 s; delay = inferred arrival − scheduled arrival.\n- **Late:** more than 5 min late. **Early:** more than 1 min early. On time, late and early add up to 100 % of the counted arrivals (up to rounding).\n- **Median delay:** the middle delay of the arrivals counted (negative = early).\n- **Route ranking:** route-hours with at least 30 arrivals, weighted by arrivals.\n- **Bus last stops** are measured separately from GPS positions and are not part of these numbers.","min_events":30,"ranking":[{"events":12005,"late_share":0.09,"on_time_share":0.4721,"route_id":"2"},{"events":7243,"late_share":0.1455,"on_time_share":0.4802,"route_id":"5"},{"events":7259,"late_share":0.0858,"on_time_share":0.5706,"route_id":"3"},{"events":8102,"late_share":0.0853,"on_time_share":0.5989,"route_id":"4"},{"events":8246,"late_share":0.0414,"on_time_share":0.7413,"route_id":"7"},{"events":2431,"late_share":0.1538,"on_time_share":0.7631,"route_id":"6X"},{"events":10565,"late_share":0.1009,"on_time_share":0.8447,"route_id":"6"},{"events":14970,"late_share":0.0371,"on_time_share":0.9261,"route_id":"1"}],"routes":[{"events":12005,"late_share":0.09,"on_time_share":0.4721,"route_id":"2"},{"events":7243,"late_share":0.1455,"on_time_share":0.4802,"route_id":"5"},{"events":7259,"late_share":0.0858,"on_time_share":0.5706,"route_id":"3"},{"events":8102,"late_share":0.0853,"on_time_share":0.5989,"route_id":"4"},{"events":8246,"late_share